# BioBuy Environment Variables Configuration

# If connecting directly to a Supabase PostgreSQL backend:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-public-key

# Note: If no Supabase credentials are provided, BioBuy automatically runs on its built-in
# high-performance reactive database engine with cross-tab realtime synchronization via BroadcastChannel!
